[0.012, "o", "Back up /home/operator/lab/secrets: it holds the master key, and `relish council recover` needs it if the cluster ever loses its quorum. Keep it somewhere safe off this machine, such as your password manager, but not with the root CA backup.\r\n(--yes: not waiting for you to confirm the backup)\r\nThe root CA key is only in /home/operator/lab/root-ca-backup.age, which /home/operator/.reliaburger/root-backup-keys/root-ab75db0f7cef2b2a.age-identity opens. Move both offline, apart from each other: no machine holds either.\r\n"]
[0.042, "o", "  lab-1 (52:54:00:00:00:01 at 10.42.0.11): claimed\r\n"]
[0.042, "o", "  lab-2 (52:54:00:00:00:02 at 10.42.0.12): claimed\r\n"]
[0.042, "o", "  lab-3 (52:54:00:00:00:03 at 10.42.0.13): claimed\r\ncluster lab created in /home/operator/lab\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "relish now talks to this cluster (node 1, https://10.42.0.11:9117).\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "waiting for lab-1, lab-2, lab-3 to start (up to 180 s)\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "  lab-1: up\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "  lab-2: up\r\n  lab-3: up\r\n"]
